  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3802.04 Voluntary Emission Reduction (VER)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3802.04 “Voluntary Emission Reduction (VER)” means a voluntary emission reduction of one or more greenhouse gases generated over a discrete period of time, and measured in weight.\n\nSource. #9470, eff 5-16-09 (from Env-A 3803.05)",
